<div class="steps"><div class="step active"><strong>01 · Generate</strong><span>Create a versioned snapshot and SHA-256 hash.</span></div><div class="step"><strong>02 · Validate</strong><span>Verify schema, network identity, and snapshot hash.</span></div><div class="step"><strong>03 · Stage</strong><span>Freeze a validated snapshot for release.</span></div><div class="step"><strong>04 · Publish</strong><span>Sign the staged snapshot before delivery is permitted.</span></div></div>
